      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].nameTag
      value: Minimart Clerk
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].nameTag
      value: GameStart Employee
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[4].nameTag
      value: Pepper
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[5].nameTag
      value: GameStart Employee
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[6].nameTag
      value: GameStart Employee
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: I'm an edgy emo!!!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: My life is misery!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].dialogueText
      value: I think that's cool!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].dialogueText
      value: It's not a phase, mom!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[4].dialogueText
      value: Who are you talking to?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[5].dialogueText
      value: Mom, you're embarrasing me in front of a customer! Can you please hang
        up?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[6].dialogueText
      value: Yeah, yeah. Turkey sounds good. Love you, too. Bye.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[7].dialogueText
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[8].dialogueText
      value: You heard nothing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: Welcome to Stegos ARR Us, how can I-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: Waaaait a second...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].dialogueText
      value: You seem familiar.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].dialogueText
      value: I must have seen you somewhere before.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[4].dialogueText
      value: Are you sure?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[5].dialogueText
      value: Well, I don't really leave my room except when they make me work, so
        it's probably my imagination.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[6].dialogueText
      value: But I still have the right to believe it!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[7].dialogueText
      value: You're from that video game! Dream Disc Delivery!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[8].dialogueText
      value: You heard nothing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: If you do decide to buy anything, I'm charging you extra.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: What for?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].dialogueText
      value: Because life is nothing but endless suffering, and you're making me
        suffer even more.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].dialogueText
      value: What are you doing here?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[4].dialogueText
      value: We don't have new games. I wanna see what's just come out.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[5].dialogueText
      value: Suuuure. Well go look around, but it's all just the same 3 games with
        different coats of paint nowadays.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[6].dialogueText
      value: And I've got my eye on you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194406, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: facingDirection
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
